<title>USA: Tandem sets $50 mln share buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Tandem sets $50 mln share buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tandem Computers Inc said on Tuesday its board authorized the buyback of up to $50 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>Tandem has about 122 million shares of common stock outstanding, it said.</p>
</text>
